    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.4.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "It came to pass when Andrew the apostle of Christ went forth from the city of the man-eaters, behold a luminous cloud snatched him up, and carried him away to the mountain where Peter and Matthew and Alexander were sitting.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
