  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew#ActPetAndr.4.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew",
    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.4.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "but the men of that city have done me many mischiefs, for they dragged me through their street three days, so that my blood stained the whole street.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      500,
      800
