    "work_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew",
    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.5.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But be bold; I will give you rest in one hour of repose in the kingdom of my Father.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      500,
      800
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew#ActPetAndr.5.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew",
    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.5.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Arise, then, and go into the city of the barbarians, and preach in it; and I will be with you in the wonders that shall happen in it by your hands.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      500,
