    "work_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew",
    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.6.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And after they had come near the city, Andrew answered and said to Peter: Father Peter, have we again to undergo toils in this city, as in the country of the man-eaters?",
