  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew#ActPetAndr.6.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew",
    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.6.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "if we go up to him, let us say to him, Give us bread; and if he give us bread, we may know that we are not to suffer in this city;",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      500,
      800
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew#ActPetAndr.6.s5",
    "work_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew",
    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.6.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "but if he say to us, We have no bread, on the other hand, we shall know that suffering again awaits us. And when they came up to the old man, Peter says to him: Hail, farmer!",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      500,
