    "work_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew",
    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.6.s13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Then Andrew took the plough out of Peter’s hand, and sowed the wheat, saying: O seed cast into the ground in the field of the righteous, come up, and come to the light.",
