    "work_id": "anf-works/acts-of-peter-and-andrew",
    "canonical_ref": "ActPetAndr.6.s15",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "for, behold, the apostles of Christ are coming into the city, pardoning the sins of those who believe in them, and healing every disease, and every sickness.",
